  {
    "number": 116,
    "title": "Reconcile Pixoo dashboard physical acceptance",
    "body": "Reconciles Pixoo #30 dashboard physical evidence and the selected complete-frame method with a configurable 1000 ms minimum interval. Preserves the cancelled write's possible effects, explicit restart, clock uncertainty and downstream integration/real-client acceptance boundaries.\n\nCompanion to jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade#62. The initial candidate records that PR as pending; final source CI, issue status and paginated history will be reconciled before this guide merges. Architecture ownership and command flows do not change, so diagram definitions and review pins remain unchanged. No product specification delta applies.\n\nLocal guide generation, five maintenance tests and browser checks at six viewports plus print passed. Final candidate output consistency, independent Standards/Specification reviews and the documented guide-only CI-filter evidence remain required. Public publication and installation are outside scope.\n",
    "state": "open",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/116",
